  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Development of youth &amp; women-UNDP-GAB-00133245</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Strengthen local development management capacities and improve productivity. Assistance in agricultural revenues creation for people living in Oyem and Bitam in Woleu Ntem, North Gabon. The project aims at strengthening agropastoral productivity and strengthen the resilience of vulnerable populations through the development of the most promising value chains that can provide decent employment for youth and women in Gabon. Theproject will support 500 households in one (1) province of the country</narrative>
  </description>
